{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 159, "line_no": 2, "text": "不一会，雅押双膝开始不住地抖动（一直到问卜结束止），伸开双手，掌朝上，念数", "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 262, "w": 1471, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "不一会，雅押双膝开始不住地抖动（一直到问卜结束止），伸开双手，掌朝上，念数", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 217, "y": 262, "w": 1471, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 159, "line_no": 3, "text": "手指关节（直至结束）。先是口中喃喃自语一阵，接着唱起唤神歌：", "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 326, "w": 1154, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "手指关节（直至结束）。先是口中喃喃自语一阵，接着唱起唤神歌：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 141, "y": 326, "w": 1154, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 159, "line_no": 4, "text": "众神仙啊众先生，", "bbox_px": {"x": 466, "y": 394, "w": 310, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "众神仙啊众先生，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 466, "y": 394, "w": 310, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 159, "line_no": 5, "text": "众先生啊众仙人。", "bbox_px": {"x": 466, "y": 459, "w": 310, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "众先生啊众仙人。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 466, "y": 459, "w": 310, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 159, "line_no": 6, "text": "有人找到我“代言”，", "bbox_px": {"x": 466, "y": 519, "w": 358, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "有人找到我“代言”，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 466, "y": 519, "w": 358, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 159, "line_no": 7, "text": "凡人来找我“替身”。", "bbox_px": {"x": 466, "y": 583, "w": 358, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "凡人来找我“替身”。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 466, "y": 583, "w": 358, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 159, "line_no": 8, "text": "互相邀约快快走，", "bbox_px": {"x": 466, "y": 656, "w": 310, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "互相邀约快快走，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 466, "y": 656, "w": 310, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
